# Courier drop-offs at the city's new plazas: after Clarion Alley the orders go up to Harvey Milk
# Plaza (Castro and Market: two burritos under the rainbow flag, 130 s) and then down to 16th St
# Mission BART (a commuter whose train is "eight minutes away", 105 s), then on to Valencia. Here the
# first three are delivered by teleport, then the two plaza orders; each adds its seconds to what is left.
park sf
spawn valencia_shops
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 run courier
cmd 200 teleport -55.3 -305 2.61 356
cmd 400 teleport -235 -230 12.53 356
cmd 600 teleport -18.5 -395.2 1.89 356
cmd 800 teleport -589.5 -28.5 19.26 240
cmd 1000 teleport 96.5 -202 -1.55 40
run 1100
expect event courierPickup{leg=3,id=rainbow,seconds=130} within 600..602
expect event courierDeliver{n=4,id=rainbow,points=1000} within 800..802
expect event courierPickup{leg=4,id=bart,seconds=105,place=16th St Mission BART} within 800..802
expect event courierDeliver{n=5,id=bart,place=16th St Mission BART} within 1000..1002
expect event courierPickup{leg=5,id=barista} within 1000..1002
expect event goalComplete{id=courier5} within 1000..1002
expect session.courierDone == 5 at 1050
expect no event courierFail
